                {
                    "id": "fb322711-3715-4089-b01b-aa29a10c3588",
                    "notes": "If the enemy has a DVA or rein that you fear might block a lot of your helix rockets, this is also a good first round pick to provide you a little extra survivability when you\u2019re getting dove. I always take this and Hunkered Down as the first two powers due to their synergy. Come round 3, Every time you helix rocket, you will get a healing station down and overhealth. The overhealth received from Helix rocket also stacks with your healing station ability. So you get double.",
                    "action": "buy",
                    "upgrade_id": "20863047-0978-4bcd-b75f-499fac432ff0"
                },
                {
                    "id": "5f71f9af-f068-4a89-8c10-1d063f3d8ddb",
                    "notes": "Damage is still king on this build so that you can continue to kill things as you get later and later into the game. Early rounds have more of an emphasis on Survivability though to allow you to stay in the fights longer and doing more sustained damage due to that.",
                    "action": "buy",
                    "upgrade_id": "2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0"
                },
                {
                    "id": "31057169-d869-4d76-ac55-f11f0d779df7",
                    "notes": "Lifesteal is something you should always have at least 1 item of in your build at all times. While you\u2019re doing damage you will be repairing your armor back onto yourself to refresh your damage reduction.",
                    "action": "buy",
                    "upgrade_id": "25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318"
                },
                {
                    "id": "02e85a25-02d1-4043-94cb-add02de4de0e",
                    "notes": "Armor is incredibly strong in stadium to reduce some of the incoming burst damage you will receive. Soldier\u2019s self-healing combined with the overhealth you will get from this build will allow you to constantly repair your armor for maximum uptime of damage reduction.",
                    "action": "buy",
                    "upgrade_id": "358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ff86929d-ccd6-4d4e-848a-ba3e2d45e40e",
                    "notes": "Hunker Down is a solid start that allows you to get some extra sustain in the early rounds. Ideally, you want to start every single engagement with your helix rocket. This will allow you to stay on angles even longer and heal up some of that initial chip damage you might take at the start of your trade.",
                    "action": "optional",
                    "upgrade_id": "bfe7eeda-26d6-464a-9478-6c4a388d1577"
                }
            ]
        },
